## 🌐 Overall Vision

<table>
<tr>
<td>

The overarching vision for **Traveloop** is to become a **personalized, intelligent, and collaborative platform** that transforms the way individuals plan and experience travel.

The platform aims to empower users to **dream, design, and organize** trips with ease by offering an end-to-end travel planning tool that combines flexibility and interactivity. It envisions a world where users can:

- 🗺️ Explore **global destinations** with rich, curated information
- 📅 Visualize their **journeys through structured itineraries**
- 💡 Make **cost-effective decisions** backed by real-time budget data
- 🤝 **Share their travel plans** within a growing community of explorers

Traveloop is built on the belief that travel planning should be **as exciting as the trip itself** — not a chore, but an experience.

</td>
</tr>
</table>

---

## 🎯 Mission

Our mission for the **Odoo × KAHE Hackathon '26** is to build a **user-centric, responsive application** that simplifies the complexity of planning multi-city travel. The platform provides travelers with intuitive tools to:

| 🎯 | Goal | What It Means |
|:--:|:-----|:--------------|
| ➕ | **Add & Manage Stops** | Easily create, reorder, and remove travel stops and durations |
| 🔍 | **Explore Cities & Activities** | Discover destinations and experiences tailored to your interests |
| 💰 | **Estimate Budgets Automatically** | Get smart cost estimates broken down by transport, stay, meals, and activities |
| 📅 | **Visualize Timelines & Plans** | See your entire journey laid out in an interactive, day-wise calendar |
| 🌐 | **Share Trip Plans** | Publish itineraries publicly or share private links with friends and family |

> 💬 *"Bridging the gap between travel inspiration and real-world execution."*

---

## ❗ Problem Statement

Planning multi-city travel is historically **complex, fragmented, and stressful**. Travelers are forced to juggle multiple disconnected tools — spreadsheets for budgeting, browser tabs for researching destinations, calendar apps for dates, and note apps for reminders. There is no single platform that ties all of this together seamlessly.

**The Challenge:** Design and develop a complete travel planning application where users can:

- ✅ Create **customized multi-city itineraries**
- ✅ Assign **travel dates, activities, and budgets** to each stop
- ✅ **Discover activities and destinations** through intelligent search
- ✅ Receive **cost breakdowns and visual calendars** for complete trip visibility
- ✅ **Share their plans** publicly or privately with friends

The application must demonstrate proper use of a **relational database** to store and retrieve complex travel data — including user-specific itineraries, stops, activities, and estimated expenses — while supporting **dynamic user interfaces** that adapt to each user's trip flow.

---

## 📱 Platform Support

Traveloop is designed to be **fully responsive**, working seamlessly across both desktop and mobile devices.

<div align="center">

| 💻 Desktop | 📱 Mobile |
|:----------:|:---------:|
| Full-featured planning experience with expanded layouts | Optimized touch-friendly interface for on-the-go access |
| Side-by-side activity browsing and itinerary building | Collapsible panels and mobile-first navigation |
| Rich chart visualizations for budgeting | Compact card views for trips and activities |

</div>

